    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** 908 Devices is riding broad demand across its mass spectrometry and FTIR handheld platforms, with the newly launched Viper device gaining swift traction in health, safety, and defense applications. Recurring service and consumables revenue is expanding, adding predictability. International sales are becoming a larger share of the mix, and the company is extending its narcotics identification reach into adjacent markets through the acquisition of NIRLAB.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership delivered a milestone positive adjusted EBITDA quarter and subsequently raised the full-year revenue outlook, signaling improving operating leverage and confidence in the product pipeline. The disciplined NIRLAB acquisition complements organic innovation, while the rapid Viper ramp demonstrates capable commercialization. These steps are gradually building market credibility around management’s ability to execute on both growth and profitability.",
